scr_text("H-hey...Bobby, how's it going?", spr_frenchie_down_stare);
scr_text("You tell him that you're doing pretty ok yourself.");
scr_text("Y-yeah. I'm not all josh and giddy myself, but...", spr_frenchie_down_stare);
scr_text("It is a rather nice day today. The birds are singing, there's stuff like...kittens and stuff.", spr_frenchie_down_stare, 0);
